  "about": {
    "title": "A genuine team sport experience",
    "body": "Mikey's League brings the community together through inclusive sports. Children and young adults with physical or intellectual disabilities play alongside peer partners, with structured practices, intentional coaching and teams built so everyone's talents can shine. Programs run in Chandler, Tolleson and Tucson."
